Subject: [PATCH] zyimage: use macOS byte order helpers

Use the native macOS little endian conversion while preserving the
Linux and BSD include paths.

Signed-off-by: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>

--- a/src/zyimage.c
+++ b/src/zyimage.c
@@ -10,6 +10,9 @@
 #include <unistd.h>
 #if defined(__linux__)
 #include <endian.h>
+#elif defined(__APPLE__)
+#include <libkern/OSByteOrder.h>
+#define htole32(x) OSSwapHostToLittleInt32(x)
 #else
 #include <sys/endian.h>
 #endif
